The '''World''' of [[Free Realms]] consist of public [[Locations|locations]] that all players can venture to. It consist of events and scenarios that all players can participate in together, without a limit to how many players are able to be there. [[Sacred Grove]] and [[Sunstone Valley]] are the only regions in the World.

