==What is NOT in the World?==
Certain areas that aren't publicly available or stationed are considered '''instances'''. Instances are special areas, typically a dungeon, that generates a new copy of the location for each group, or for a certain number of players that enter the area. Some examples are:
*[[Dungeons]]
*[[Lots]] (if not added to the [[Housing Directory]])
*[[Mini-Games|Minigames]]
